Return only found keys.\\n\\nMessage subject: Your free trial extension is about to end\\nSender email: [EMAIL]\\nMessage body:\\n<><> Hi Aziz, Your extended Intercom trial ends today. Here’s what you’ll miss out on without Intercom: Fin, the #1 AI Agent for Customer Service. Fin handles even the more complex queries by learning your procedures, knowledge, and policies. You can test it before launch, deploy it across every channel, and continuously improve it with AI-powered insights. A next-gen Helpdesk designed for efficiency. Intercom equips support agents with powerful AI tools, actionable insights, and seamless workflows, so they can work more efficiently and resolve customer queries faster. https://intercom.intercom-clicks.com/via/e?ob=mOd48NF%2FHCSLtzr3iGlgve1c0KTbK%2BY5zuntAGEDPyTs62EB00WtqW9mR0IjE%2BhCFJojOmim0NZsdj0I6WQ%2FCSePL5eMVVvqf97gNDn1WfdqDhXcb6hzdNWLvn4UAtN7&h=36be15ede84f503773c4edc6b0d3945f44c40f16-tx2p130c_215474517873513&l=fe19edc927941ef4e74acc50dc1bb98aba3e1f0c-201193486 Explore our plans We have plans to suit the needs of every support team: https://intercom.intercom-clicks.com/via/e?ob=mOd48NF%2FHCSLtzr3iGlgve1c0KTbK%2BY5zuntAGEDPyTs62EB00WtqW9mR0IjE%2BhCFJojOmim0NZsdj0I6WQ%2FCSePL5eMVVvqf97gNDn1WfdqDhXcb6hzdNWLvn4UAtN7&h=36be15ede84f503773c4edc6b0d3945f44c40f16-tx2p130c_215474517873513&l=ef3a34db15c3fd9dbeec06c4a367a58aca536699-201256494 Essential Starting from $29 per seat/month Perfect for individuals and small businesses looking to get started with providing AI-first customer service. https://intercom.intercom-clicks.com/via/e?ob=mOd48NF%2FHCSLtzr3iGlgve1c0KTbK%2BY5zuntAGEDPyTs62EB00WtqW9mR0IjE%2BhCFJojOmim0NZsdj0I6WQ%2FCSePL5eMVVvqf97gNDn1WfdqDhXcb6hzdNWLvn4UAtN7&h=36be15ede84f503773c4edc6b0d3945f44c40f16-tx2p130c_215474517873513&l=fe19edc927941ef4e74acc50dc1bb98aba3e1f0c-201193486 Advanced Starting from $85 per seat/month Great for supporting a growing customer base and enhancing the customer experience without increasing headcount. h