78	kb_chunk	5	7	1	Hinweis zur Zwischenversorgung\n\nWährend Rabots Belieferung noch nicht aktiv ist, verbleibt der Kunde **nicht** beim bisherigen Anbieter. Je nach Fall gilt:\n\n1. **Lieferantenwechsel:** Der Vorversorger-Vertrag wurde bereits gekündigt. Der Kunde wird bis zum Rabot-Lieferbeginn durch den **Grundversorger** beliefert.\n2. **Einzug:** Ist die Rabot-Anmeldung noch nicht wirksam, übernimmt ebenfalls der **Grundversorger** die Versorgung überbrückend.\n\nDiese Information ist bei Kundennachfragen zur Zwischenzeit aktiv zu kommunizieren – insbesondere in Situation C, wenn ein Widerruf diskutiert wird und der Kunde wissen möchte, wer ihn bis dahin versorgt.\n\n**Nicht kommunizieren:** „Solange unsere Belieferung nicht aktiv ist, bleiben Sie beim bisherigen Anbieter.“ – dies ist bei Lieferantenwechsel und Einzug sachlich falsch.	bf7f60fe7251710307b2b43f54fa8fe4d764c34bfa5fca76a42fdf913b093d6c	voyage/voyage-3-large@2025-01	[-0.08770752,0.02268982,0.021636963,0.018722534,0.07867432,0.009162903,0.03201294,0.017700195,0.014144897,-0.020339966,-0.026306152,-0.015777588,-0.03112793,-0.011528015,-0.0029735565,-0.0064926147,0.014480591,0.08666992,0.007598877,0.025115967,0.013771057,-0.076660156,0.007255554,-8.273125e-05,-0.0008401871,-0.058776855,0.024414062,0.035369873,-0.013938904,0.016052246,-0.031097412,-0.027633667,0.0035953522,0.035461426,0.0055885315,-0.0135269165,-0.02204895,0.0005674362,-0.018203735,-0.019256592,-0.04156494,0.04345703,0.04598999,-0.049560547,0.01689148,-0.01512146,-0.009056091,0.04824829,-0.013183594,-0.022903442,-0.018798828,0.01474762,0.026824951,0.013504028,0.006401062,-0.013122559,-0.039215088,-0.018569946,0.0993042,0.011375427,-0.058898926,0.016677856,-0.015022278,0.09118652,-0.035491943,0.04260254,0.062164307,-0.019851685,0.014961243,-0.013076782,0.045837402,0.017120361,0.004589081,0.05682373,-0.011077881,-0.0006117821,-0.029464722,0.013450623,-0.031585693,0.0036678314,0.0069465637,0.012687683,-0.003824234,-0.021133423,0.04989624,-