79	kb_chunk	5	7	2	Situation A – Lieferbeginn erklären\n\n**Zweck:** Lieferstart transparent erklären und Erwartungsmanagement setzen.\n\nBedingungen:\n\n1. Delivery Status ist **Delivery** oder **Delivery Pending**.\n2. Kunde fragt allgemein, wann die Belieferung beginnt – kein konkretes Wunschdatum, kein Unmut über den Termin.\n\nLösungswege:\n\nSchritt 1 – Erstreaktion\n\n1. Geplanten Lieferstart nennen (sofern im System ersichtlich).\n2. Erklären, dass der Lieferstart das Ergebnis automatisierter Marktprozesse ist.\n3. Erläutern, dass der bisherige Lieferant einem früheren Termin in der Regel nicht zugestimmt hat.\n4. Klar kommunizieren, dass ein Vorziehen des Liefertermins nicht möglich ist.\n\n**Aktion:** Dem Kunden den geplanten Lieferstart nennen und erklären, warum der Termin nicht vorgezogen werden kann. Ticket auf solved setzen.	76c89d0e8049b57ac11247bea730cb03b2ad6a9f42880928345400a24ca6635d	voyage/voyage-3-large@2025-01	[-0.038146973,0.051513672,0.002298355,-0.009742737,0.051513672,-0.0013608932,0.020828247,0.021469116,0.024810791,-0.012145996,-0.019500732,-0.0126953125,-0.024993896,0.011917114,0.010673523,-0.005241394,0.022415161,0.07519531,0.010971069,-0.03466797,0.022262573,-0.05883789,-0.004146576,-0.009857178,-0.0016965866,-0.029830933,0.057525635,0.06329346,-0.0027236938,0.015808105,-0.025482178,0.007030487,0.017791748,0.018157959,0.021743774,0.012008667,0.015945435,-0.006351471,0.026290894,-0.018539429,-0.041290283,0.007461548,0.018829346,-0.08831787,0.0181427,0.011177063,-0.042114258,0.03591919,-0.053619385,-0.0039711,-0.02545166,0.0005130768,0.05206299,-0.028625488,0.006729126,-0.014846802,-0.04055786,-0.012214661,0.05593872,0.017227173,-0.03741455,0.015655518,-0.0064964294,0.0692749,-0.015960693,0.028762817,0.04675293,-0.022583008,0.00365448,0.0010309219,0.036590576,-0.0077590942,0.0138549805,0.04675293,-0.047698975,0.009597778,-0.01008606,0.038391113,-0.061553955,-0.024230957,-0.007881165,0.019821167,-0.009635925,-0.020599365,0.06463623,-0.016