90	kb_chunk	4	7	1	Situation A – Namensänderung\n\n**Zweck:** Rechtssichere Anpassung des Vertragsnamens.\n\n**Bedingungen:**\n\n- Kunde möchte den im Vertrag hinterlegten Namen ändern (z. B. nach Heirat oder Scheidung).\n\n**Lösungswege:**\n\nSchritt 1 – Erstreaktion (Agent):\n\n1. Kunden informieren, dass eine Namensänderung möglich ist.\n2. Entsprechende Nachweise beim Kunden anfragen (z. B. Eheurkunde oder Scheidungsurkunde).\n\n**Aktion Schritt 1:** Kunden um Zusendung der erforderlichen Nachweise bitten (z. B. Ehe- oder Scheidungsurkunde). Das Ticket kann nicht abschließend beantwortet werden – ein Mitarbeiter muss es übernehmen.\n\nSchritt 2 – Nach Eingang der Unterlagen (Mitarbeiter):\n\n1. Namensänderung im System durchführen.\n2. Kunden informieren, dass die gewünschte Anpassung vorgenommen wurde.	1865118f4469e753003b6ab2ab70da717fe4238d0e4548cb635cf7efa6c8b20c	voyage/voyage-3-large@2025-01	[-0.084472656,0.053649902,-0.023468018,-0.013969421,0.02458191,0.005847931,0.0055160522,0.016845703,0.0075569153,-0.029556274,-0.029785156,-0.034332275,-0.017578125,-0.0058288574,-0.03805542,-0.020690918,-0.007545471,0.06561279,0.031311035,-0.022277832,-0.006717682,-0.06329346,-0.0039749146,-0.005027771,-0.005458832,-0.025970459,0.05014038,0.012031555,0.009223938,0.006462097,-0.043182373,-0.008094788,-0.010971069,0.028152466,0.03286743,0.038360596,-0.013671875,0.009017944,-0.03765869,-0.037322998,-0.0357666,-0.0029296875,0.016204834,-0.101135254,0.0028438568,0.0011310577,-0.021820068,0.06628418,-0.019378662,-0.024551392,-0.03652954,-0.014579773,0.036346436,-0.04156494,-0.023635864,-0.014045715,-0.019485474,0.0029735565,0.03729248,-0.009719849,-0.008850098,0.026046753,0.033355713,0.08502197,-0.035827637,0.008766174,0.06488037,-0.006248474,0.03640747,-0.0129470825,0.024093628,-0.013954163,0.04296875,0.016937256,-0.017745972,-0.028945923,-0.018661499,0.019317627,-0.02822876,-0.025527954,0.005809784,-0.014053345,-0.012832642,0.017868042,0.03942871,-0.052520752,0.079833984,-0