98	kb_chunk	5	8	1	Hinweis zur Zwischenversorgung\n\nWährend Rabots Belieferung noch nicht aktiv ist, verbleibt der Kunde **nicht** beim bisherigen Anbieter. Je nach Fall gilt:\n\n1. **Lieferantenwechsel:** Der Vorversorger-Vertrag wurde bereits gekündigt. Der Kunde wird bis zum Rabot-Lieferbeginn durch den **Grundversorger** beliefert.\n2. **Einzug:** Ist die Rabot-Anmeldung noch nicht wirksam, übernimmt ebenfalls der **Grundversorger** die Versorgung überbrückend.\n\nDiese Information ist bei Kundennachfragen zur Zwischenzeit aktiv zu kommunizieren – insbesondere in Situation C, wenn ein Widerruf diskutiert wird und der Kunde wissen möchte, wer ihn bis dahin versorgt.\n\n**Nicht kommunizieren:** „Solange unsere Belieferung nicht aktiv ist, bleiben Sie beim bisherigen Anbieter.“ – dies ist bei Lieferantenwechsel und Einzug sachlich falsch.	bf7f60fe7251710307b2b43f54fa8fe4d764c34bfa5fca76a42fdf913b093d6c	voyage/voyage-3-large@2025-01	[-0.087890625,0.022750854,0.021713257,0.018569946,0.07879639,0.008895874,0.032073975,0.018005371,0.014091492,-0.020111084,-0.026321411,-0.015899658,-0.031158447,-0.011505127,-0.003047943,-0.0065460205,0.014259338,0.08679199,0.007850647,0.024810791,0.013389587,-0.07720947,0.0073280334,-0.00010031462,-0.00078201294,-0.05871582,0.02407837,0.035583496,-0.014022827,0.015991211,-0.03112793,-0.027938843,0.0034389496,0.03540039,0.0056495667,-0.013404846,-0.021820068,0.00091028214,-0.018188477,-0.019439697,-0.041503906,0.04348755,0.04598999,-0.049438477,0.01713562,-0.015609741,-0.009162903,0.048309326,-0.0129470825,-0.02293396,-0.019042969,0.014671326,0.026779175,0.01373291,0.0063934326,-0.01348114,-0.039276123,-0.018661499,0.099243164,0.01158905,-0.059051514,0.017181396,-0.015090942,0.09112549,-0.035369873,0.042663574,0.06222534,-0.019622803,0.015113831,-0.012870789,0.045837402,0.017425537,0.0044555664,0.056640625,-0.010902405,-0.0006761551,-0.029434204,0.013282776,-0.031829834,0.0034923553,0.006877899,0.012367249,-0.0037345886,-0.021087646,0.04