111	kb_chunk	5	9	6	Muster-Reply:\n\nVielen Dank für Ihre Nachricht. Wir verstehen, dass ein Lieferstart zum \\[Datum\\] nicht Ihrer Erwartung entspricht.\n\nLeider ist eine nachträgliche Änderung des Lieferbeginns auf unserer Seite nicht möglich – das Datum wird im Rahmen des Wechselprozesses zwischen Ihrem bisherigen Versorger, dem Netzbetreiber und Rabot festgelegt.\n\nSie haben jedoch die Möglichkeit, Ihren Vertrag zu widerrufen. In diesem Fall stornieren wir Ihren Auftrag sofort und vollständig – ohne weitere Kosten für Sie.\n\nBitte bestätigen Sie uns kurz, ob Sie den Widerruf wünschen, und wir veranlassen alles Weitere umgehend.\n\n**Aktion:** Ticket auf pending_customer setzen (Tool pending_customer nutzen).	56fea406ea43c80604daa87f6604a3e333f65b3fc46b776b3d106a15fec6f67c	voyage/voyage-3-large@2025-01	[-0.0574646,0.042053223,0.003993988,-0.01890564,0.07696533,0.015853882,0.01411438,0.026824951,0.025268555,-0.04638672,-0.018936157,-0.005203247,-0.030975342,0.012390137,0.0021362305,0.0034503937,0.017242432,0.059509277,0.0059318542,0.029220581,0.03253174,-0.06817627,-0.0056877136,0.0034179688,-0.029281616,-0.021697998,0.04852295,0.058410645,-0.010055542,-0.0032577515,-0.041534424,-0.015403748,-0.015235901,0.0104522705,0.0048065186,0.009147644,-0.017974854,-0.0028934479,0.002998352,-0.036193848,-0.02758789,0.0098724365,0.05493164,-0.12670898,0.008811951,-0.019760132,-0.037719727,0.028961182,-0.02357483,-0.018173218,-0.02658081,0.01158905,0.039398193,-0.041870117,0.020523071,-0.012924194,-0.056030273,-0.0093307495,0.06512451,-0.006084442,-0.046936035,-0.00074768066,-0.008773804,0.0680542,-0.01725769,0.050811768,0.07611084,-0.01789856,0.012145996,-4.053116e-05,0.06677246,0.010017395,0.031082153,0.049102783,-0.03591919,0.008666992,-0.017929077,0.02822876,-0.036499023,-0.02696228,0.004295349,-0.008743286,0.0021343231,0.006916046,0.08239746,-0.04220581,0.009033203,-0.010009766,0.051483154,-0.0067710876,0.014801025,0.03869629,0.0049095154,0.055114746,-0.0074806213,0.03